{
  "analysis": "The review mainly requests hypothetical features, which are excluded by R12. However, the request to \"see how much time is left for upgrades\" explicitly describes existing upgrade timers, an imposed wait associated with building or upgrading, so T_PlayingByAppointment applies. The decoration-removal option, account toggling, and hidden troop statistics do not match any label.",
