{
  "analysis": "The review describes an in-game advertisement that cannot be dismissed and redirects taps to the store, so T_Advertisement applies. The absent close control and misleading tap behavior obstruct the opt-out and direct attention toward a purchase destination, so M_UIMisdirection applies. T_MandatoryMarathon was considered but rejected because the review does not say that exiting forfeits progress or value; the forced ad alone is insufficient under its boundary rule. No web search was needed.",
  "labels": [
    {
      "label": "T_Advertisement",
      "span": "after seeing the ads, there is no way to close it",
      "rationale": "The player is compelled to remain in an in-game advertisement because it cannot be closed."
