{
  "analysis": "The review describes capture attempts consuming Poké Balls unusually quickly, leading the player to purchase more, which makes payment necessary to continue this gameplay activity; this supports Pay to Progress. It also states that a review was posted under the player's identity despite the player denying authorship, supporting Friend Spam / Impersonation. Intermediate Currency is rejected because Poké Balls are items rather than purchased in-game currency. Gambling, Advertisement, and Easy to Purchase are rejected because no wager, ad viewing, or purchase-intercepting interface is described.",
